                                                "example_id": "6774307e-9335-448e-b699-89ce47e15146",
                                                "sense_id": "984da532-4b05-343b-9f4f-7dd6635ac825",
                                                "text": "Her recent weight loss has made her look rather skinny than slender"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "8d8c3f61-83a5-3a6f-a1ab-264500bdaf56",
                                        "entry_id": "4af3a520-93bf-3054-9c27-ce5cbebecb7b",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Of food or a beverage, having reduced fat or calories."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "informal"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "5dc0147a-ee5a-4e32-8057-721a3af824a3",
                                                "sense_id": "8d8c3f61-83a5-3a6f-a1ab-264500bdaf56",
                                                "text": "...into the skinny chocolate milk?"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "4966484e-7cf3-4370-bf19-de2e76f4e6e0",
                                                "sense_id": "8d8c3f61-83a5-3a6f-a1ab-264500bdaf56",
                                                "text": "Also bring me three quarts of ‘skinny’ milk. What the matter, Mr. Kuziavka, have you just fallen from the moon?! Don't you know about ‘skinny’ milk? It's milk, from which the fat has been removed and..."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "226fc53a-acc3-4dd6-b719-80da19593c39",
                                                "sense_id": "8d8c3f61-83a5-3a6f-a1ab-264500bdaf56",
                                                "text": "“All right,” said Katz, who, waiting on his skinny milk latte, turned to snap his fingers at the only waiter in the room."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "80134b30-8114-4ef1-b8ef-2aa5b6291cec",
                                                "sense_id": "8d8c3f61-83a5-3a6f-a1ab-264500bdaf56",
                                                "text": "People always order a \"skinny\" margarita without knowing exactly what that means for the ingredients. Skinny means the cocktail has a natural sweetener like lime juice or agave nectar, and none of that slushy, syrupy sweet-and-sour mix."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "d0c3f305-d050-3fa1-8dff-18556368bcf5",
                                        "entry_id": "4af3a520-93bf-3054-9c27-ce5cbebecb7b",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Naked; nude (chiefly used in the phrase skinny dipping)."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "4ce37387-c313-4250-843e-2855b8d021f5",
                                                "sense_id": "d0c3f305-d050-3fa1-8dff-18556368bcf5",
                                                "text": "She used to swim \"skinny\" in Sprague's cove in broad daylight, leaving her bathing dress on the float."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e3c97246-a5e5-4f94-a0f7-dd07896c86e5",
                                                "sense_id": "d0c3f305-d050-3fa1-8dff-18556368bcf5",
                                                "text": "Let's take our clothes oft\" and go swimming skinny."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "75933b3f-a77a-4f1c-839a-a50dab8e476e",
                                                "sense_id": "d0c3f305-d050-3fa1-8dff-18556368bcf5",
                                                "text": "We never swam skinny in the river like the hippy kids on the farm across the railway tracks."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "bc34cf82-a5c0-4231-9384-e477c26078fa",
                                                "sense_id": "d0c3f305-d050-3fa1-8dff-18556368bcf5",
                                                "text": "When I went in again, the desirable alien was in bed with eyelids closed [...], obviously sleeping skinny, to employ her own term for it."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e61bd748-8096-499c-b66d-45d2bbac12e3",
                                                "sense_id": "d0c3f305-d050-3fa1-8dff-18556368bcf5",
                                                "text": "with stimulative sybaritic aids ranging from a mountain sunset to a dip — skinny or otherwise — in a heated pool"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "d8cf9250-0528-3747-9b50-ef2e6ad8fa40",
                                        "entry_id": "4af3a520-93bf-3054-9c27-ce5cbebecb7b",
