                                                "sense_id": "200bfb9e-939d-30f8-8bba-2321b91dffe1",
                                                "text": "Like an accordion at a country wedding producing sweet-and-sour notes, some importers are expanding their U.S. retail automotive operations while others are skinnying down."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b15113be-2987-40e8-a421-beb38359c029",
                                                "sense_id": "200bfb9e-939d-30f8-8bba-2321b91dffe1",
                                                "text": "By the end of the chapter, we will have (hopefully) skinnied the list of contenders further (perhaps there will be none left)."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "154f7113-2c2f-45c7-94f0-a7ae73221a85",
                                                "sense_id": "200bfb9e-939d-30f8-8bba-2321b91dffe1",
                                                "text": "Said one judge: \"What is [Chapter 22] other than the process of skinnying the company down? Are there some inefficiencies in that? If so, they can be absorbed by the economy and the country.\""
                                            }
